// A textured scatter of standalone note glyphs, independent of any staff
// ribbon — plain Unicode characters rather than the SVG notehead system,
// keeping this layer simple rather than adding more engraved detail.
// Pricing and FAQ have no ribbon at all (not every section needs a staff);
// this texture is their only decoration. A first hand-placed pass (2-5
// notes/section) read as too sparse to register as anything; this is
// generated by a seeded PRNG (mulberry32) for a "camo"/textured feel:
// irregular placement, sizes weighted toward small with occasional larger
// accents, varied rotation, weighted toward the plain single-note glyphs
// (♩ ♪) over the beamed-pair ones (♫ ♬) so it doesn't read as uniformly
// grouped. An earlier version mixed in ♯/♭ accidentals for variety too —
// pulled after feedback that the sharp sign just reads as a stray hashtag.
// Seeded so it's fixed and reproducible, not re-randomized per render —
// the array below is the frozen output of that generator (see design
// workspace's floating-notes.mjs), pasted as static data.
